@startuml
title Evaluate Promotion Rules\nPOST /api/v1/promotion-engine/evaluate

actor Client
participant "PromotionEngineController\n(infrastructure/adapter/in/web)" as Controller
participant "PromotionEngineService\n(application/service)" as AppService
participant "RuleCache (in-mem)\n(infrastructure/cache)" as RuleCache
participant "EvaluateRuleStore (in-mem)\n(infrastructure/cache)" as RuleStore
participant "PromotionEvaluationService\n(domain/service)" as DomainService

Client -> Controller: POST /promotion-engine/evaluate\n(cart, mode)
activate Controller

Controller -> AppService: evaluate(cart, mode)
activate AppService

== STEP 1 — Extract ruleIds from RuleIndex ==

AppService -> RuleCache: findRuleIds(cart.skus,\ncart.categories,\ncart.payment,\ncart.segment)
activate RuleCache

note right of RuleCache
RuleIndex stored in-memory:
productRuleMap
categoryRuleMap
paymentRuleMap
segmentRuleMap

Returns merged & de-duplicated:
  e.g. [1,2,4,5,7,8]
end note

RuleCache --> AppService: List<ruleId>
deactivate RuleCache

== STEP 2 — Load EvaluateRule objects ==

AppService -> RuleStore: getEvaluateRules(ruleIds)
activate RuleStore

note right of RuleStore
EvaluateRuleStore holds full\npre-parsed EvaluateRule models:
- typed conditions
- typed actions
- parsed quota struct
- parsed stacking
- start/end unix
end note

RuleStore --> AppService: List<EvaluateRule>
deactivate RuleStore

== STEP 3 — Domain Evaluation ==

AppService -> DomainService: evaluateRules(rules, cart, mode)
activate DomainService

DomainService -> DomainService: applyConditionsAndActions()
note right of DomainService
EvaluateRule execution:
- condition filtering
- action calculation
- stacking logic
- quota shallow check
- mode(light/medium/full) based constraints
end note

DomainService --> AppService: EvaluationResult
deactivate DomainService

== STEP 4 — Return Response ==

AppService --> Controller: PromotionEvaluateResponse
deactivate AppService

Controller --> Client: 200 OK\n(final eligible promotions)
deactivate Controller

@enduml
